WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.028
With Lokalise, strings
live as keys in projects,

2
00:00:04.028 --> 00:00:05.849
synced with your resource files.

3
00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:08.264
Lokalise does this well,

4
00:00:08.264 --> 00:00:11.676
with one key set per platform
and over-the-air updates.

5
00:00:12.150 --> 00:00:16.283
General Translation translates
readable copy in your JSX as

6
00:00:16.283 --> 00:00:17.490
part of development.

7
00:00:18.650 --> 00:00:21.564
Write the prompt
inside a T component,

8
00:00:21.564 --> 00:00:23.305
with the plan name in Var.

9
00:00:24.150 --> 00:00:29.803
Then npx gt translate in CI
translates new copy for its release.

10
00:00:30.650 --> 00:00:34.028
Your team can review and edit
the result in the Dashboard.

11
00:00:34.650 --> 00:00:37.296
Your team now ships
Korean with each release.
